{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"body":"Pilot ticket 53ed-ac2d-7739-4194 failed CI and exhausted its repairs, caused by four jest snapshot failures from two undeclared __snapshots__ files. Adding those paths improved the outcome, one suite recovered from FAIL to PASS, but the run then parked for a different reason, REPAIR_BUDGET_EXCEEDED with llm_calls_exceeded. Reverted 53ed to its original five declared paths and terminated the workflow. This also exposes a rebar gate gap, plan review P9 file-impact-coverage passed 53ed at five paths while its own change invalidated two undeclared snapshots."},"env_id":"8c3ef925-fbdc-4d88-8d59-f391cf59568c","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789933509743582001,"uuid":"bf6eda9c-d6f5-48f6-8e9a-4d914265f69c"}